# Dynamic library tabs

Posts, Travel, Food, Watch, and History are **not a fixed tab set**. Show a
category only when that library has items (same as web `CategoryStrip`).

- While the library is still loading and every count is 0, show all tabs.
- After load, hide any category with count 0.
- Native needs at least one tab: if every count is 0, keep **Posts** as the
  empty inbox. Do not hardcode Posts or Travel as always visible once data
  exists.
- New categories follow the same rule; do not assume five tabs.
